      "topic": "AI video generation cost: manual workflow vs automated studio pipeline (2026)",
      "summary": "In 2026, AI video models bill per second of finished output, so a short clip really can cost cents instead of the thousands per minute charged for traditional animation. The gap between doing it 'by hand' and using an automated studio pipeline is mostly speed and iteration control, not raw model price.",
