    "duration": 34.09000015258789,
    "text": "I'm going to show you two ways. The first one is to actually do everything of this by hand, which will take a lot longer, but you can generate and if you really want to spend time building this stuff, you can do it like this. And the second one is to use the Video Studio, which is a studio you get just by joining our community and you have instructions on how to install it. It's much faster, it's just some cents, like I generated a one minute video and I think it was 36 cents, so it's quite cheap compared to regular animation, but it just speeds up the process a lot more.",
